%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b8c5f8bea1b438d4687ad9b712e77c3e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level 1-6 After Battle Cutscene
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneData
  line:
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: "How pleased I was when I won my first prize, a religious picture!
      In the first quarter I gained another prize, with the grade \u201CExcellent.\u201D
      After that I did not care to apply myself. I had foolishly become dissatisfied
      because of something my teacher said. Unfortunately, this continued until the
      end of the year and I gained only second place in all my subjects. This gave
      me the grade of \u201CExcellent\u201D but without any prize."
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: "I spent the vacation at home and went with my eldest sister, Nening,
      to Tanawan, for the town festival. This was in 1873. But our pleasure was marred
      by the fact that our mother was not with us. I had gone alone to see my mother
      without first sending word either to her or to my father. This was at the close
      of the term in which I held second place. I thought with what joy I would surprise
      her. Instead, we wept in each other\u2019s arms. We had not seen each other
      for more than a year."
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: "After vacation was over, I returned to Manila and enrolled in the
      second year. Then I hunted lodgings in the Walled City. Nothing new happened
      that year. My professor was the same as in the previous year; but I had different
      schoolmates. Among them I found three who had been with me in Bi\xF1an. At
      the end of this year, I won a medal and returned to my town."
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: I again went alone to visit my mother in prison. Like another Joseph,
      I prophesied to her from a dream that her release would take place within three
      months. This prediction happened to come true.
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: 'At this time, I began to devote my leisure to reading novels. Under
      the pretext that I should have to study general history, I convinced my father
      to buy me a set of Cesar Cantu y Dios'' histories. I learned a lot by reading
      them. Despite half applying myself and my mediocre Spanish, I was able to win
      prizes in the quarterly examination. '
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: I would have won the medal if I had not made mistakes, which I spoke
      very poorly. This gave the medal to the Spanish lad who spoke his mother tongue
      better than I could. Thus, I finished my third year.
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 0
